00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.990
But it was like, you know, if
you look up the black mamba,

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.280
the snake, it's extremely deadly.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.520
- Get it, get it, Kobe.
- Extremely, you know

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.400
what I'm sayin', so like,

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.038
for me when I play basketball,
that's the space I go into.

00:00:29.038 --> 00:00:29.925
Don't mess with me.
- It's like you're

00:00:29.925 --> 00:00:30.758
Sasha Fierce.
- Don't talk to me--

00:00:30.758 --> 00:00:31.600
Exactly!
- Yeah.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.300
- Leave me alone.
- I need a name.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.133
- Yeah.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.977
- Maybe my nickname could
be Sports Ball (guffaws).

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.260
