00:00:40.571 --> 00:00:42.091
(hands clapping) I'm gonna
be White Mamba, I'm deadly!

00:00:42.091 --> 00:00:44.800
(Kelly laughing)
(audience cheering)

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.210
So wait, your name, your official
name is Kobe Bean Bryant.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:51.563
So where did Kobe and Bean come from?

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.530
- I think it came from my parents

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.228
