00:00:56.228 --> 00:00:57.850
(audience tittering)
- I was gonna say you had

00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:59.028
to have some fun parents.
- Something like that.

00:00:59.028 --> 00:01:00.631
Yeah.
- "Let's name him beef!"

00:01:00.631 --> 00:01:01.660
- I know!
- Yeah!

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.580
