the menu and was like,

00:01:10.447 --> 00:01:12.099
"Oh, that's a good name."

00:01:12.099 --> 00:01:13.170
(audience chuckling)
- Hey!

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.003
- [Kobe] And then my

00:01:14.003 --> 00:01:15.165
