- I've never met another one.

00:01:15.165 --> 00:01:16.210
- So it's like, "You
want steak and beans?"

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:18.332
Like, what you talking 'bout here?

00:01:18.332 --> 00:01:19.890
(audience and Kelly laughing)
Like what we doing right now?

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.800
- [Kelly] So where did Bean come from?

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.700
- My father's nickname when he played

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.710
was Joe Jellybean Bryant.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.320
- Jellybean, all right, so your--

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.812
- [Kobe] Still don't
make any sense though.

00:01:28.812 --> 00:01:29.645
- Your father played--
- Like, you don't

00:01:29.645 --> 00:01:30.566
call me Bean, 'cause...

00:01:30.566 --> 00:01:31.399
(Kelly laughing)
Jellybean?

00:01:31.399 --> 00:01:32.395
- I'm trying to make it cool, Kobe.

00:01:32.395 --> 00:01:34.342
- Nah, ain't no saving that.

00:01:34.342 --> 00:01:36.650
(Kelly cackling)

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:37.820
- Your dad played too then?

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:38.716
- [Kobe] He did.

00:01:38.716 --> 00:01:39.549
- That's amazing.
- He did, yeah.

00:01:39.549 --> 00:01:41.660
He played for, what was
it, eight years in the NBA

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:44.170
and then played eight years
overseas in Italy, so...

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.500
- Right, that's right, 'cause I found out

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.600
