00:01:47.433 --> 00:01:48.560
- That's sexy, Kobe,

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:49.589
I'm just sayin'.
- Oh, thank you.

00:01:49.589 --> 00:01:50.422
(audience whoops)

00:01:50.422 --> 00:01:51.255
(Kobe chortles)
- I mean, did you wanna

00:01:51.255 --> 00:01:52.380
say somethin' in Italian?

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:53.650
- Well, (speaks in Italian).

00:01:54.778 --> 00:01:58.050
(audience cheers and gushes)

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:58.909
- Okay.

00:01:58.909 --> 00:01:59.742
Okay!

00:01:59.742 --> 00:02:00.575
What does that mean?

00:02:00.575 --> 00:02:02.680
- It means, "Hello everybody,
it's a pleasure to be here."

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:03.830
- Okay, it sounded, it was cooler,

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:04.881
