00:02:04.881 --> 00:02:07.070
(Kobe chuckles)
"Kelly, you so damn sexy!"

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:08.120
That's what I heard.
(Kobe laughing)

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:08.983
I filtered it!

